				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${x}^{2}$$\end{document}x2) (Tables 1 and 2, Table S2, and Table S3). A two-sided p value < 0.05 was considered statistically significant.
